{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HoXT5gK6JLFLTWxwH3t5hi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 原始 framing 完全成立。Recency control 在 s025/s030 均确认 null phase gradient，完成\n2\t  triple dissociation 的全 sparsity range 验证，排除所有 circularity/confound 质疑。GPQA cross-benchmark\n3\t  展示 importance gradient 单调递增且 strategy specificity ratio ≥ 3×，进一步强化 phase-modulated\n4\t  compound severity 的跨 benchmark 泛化。Paper 三支柱叙事（empirical discovery + novel experimental\n5\t  design + mechanistic explanation）全部站稳，claims 无需降级。\n6\timagined_experiments:\n7\t- name: recency_s025\n8\t  plan_id: C11_recency_s025\n9\t  description: Recency-based eviction (scoring-independent control) at sparsity=0.25,\n10\t    n=100, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B. 验证 recency eviction 在中等 sparsity 下仍无 phase\n11\t    gradient。\n12\t  expected_results:\n13\t    n_problems: 100\n14\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n15\t    masking_method: recency\n16\t    sparsity: 0.25\n17\t    phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.018\n18\t    phase_gradient_cohens_dz: 0.11\n19\t    phase_gradient_p_value: 0.42\n20\t    significant: false\n21\t    low_phase_ii_median: 0.87\n22\t    high_phase_ii_median: 0.82\n23\t    low_high_ratio: 1.06\n24\t    low_high_ratio_ci:\n25\t    - -0.08\n26\t    - 2.21\n27\t    comparison_importance_s025_median_diff: 3.99\n28\t    comparison_importance_s025_dz: 0.95\n29\t    comparison_random_s025_median_diff: 0.26\n30\t    comparison_random_s025_dz: 0.12\n31\t    triple_dissociation: importance SIGNIFICANT (d_z=0.95), recency NS (d_z=0.11),\n32\t      random NS (d_z=0.12)\n33\t    imp_vs_recency_ratio: 36×\n34\t  result_rationale: Recency eviction 按 token 到达顺序驱逐最旧 token，完全不涉及 attention score\n35\t    计算。因此 head pruning 导致的 score discrimination collapse 对 recency 无影响——pruning 后\n36\t    recency 仍按同一确定性规则驱逐，不存在 importance score 退化为伪随机的路径。在 s025 下虽然 absolute perplexity\n37\t    升高（因更多有效 token 被移除），但 low-phase 和 high-phase 受到的 compound interaction 增量近似相等，因为\n38\t    recency 对两个 phase 的 eviction pattern 与 attention distribution 无关。d_z 略高于 s015\n39\t    的 0.083 是因为更高 sparsity 下 noise floor 略增，但仍远低于 0.2 阈值且统计不显著。\n40\t  tables:\n41\t  - 'Table: Triple dissociation at s025 — Importance d_z=0.95 (p<1e-50), Recency d_z=0.11\n42\t    (p=0.42, NS), Random d_z=0.12 (p=0.38, NS)'\n43\t  figures_description:\n44\t  - 'Fig: Paired median difference distribution (bootstrap B=10000) for three strategies\n45\t    at s025, showing importance distribution far from zero while recency and random\n46\t    center on zero'\n47\t  analysis: s025 recency null 结果与 s015 一致，排除了 'recency 可能在高 sparsity 下出现 phase gradient'\n48\t    的替代假设。Triple dissociation 在 s025 完整复现：attention-score-based eviction (importance)\n49\t    产生强 phase gradient，而 scoring-independent (recency) 和 structure-independent (random)\n50\t    均为 null。这确认 phase-dependent severity 是 attention score pathway 的特有效应。\n51\t- name: recency_s030\n52\t  plan_id: C11_recency_s030\n53\t  description: Recency-based eviction at sparsity=0.30, n=100. 最高 sparsity 下确认 recency\n54\t    null gradient，完成全 sparsity range triple dissociation。\n55\t  expected_results:\n56\t    n_problems: 100\n57\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n58\t    masking_method: recency\n59\t    sparsity: 0.3\n60\t    phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.041\n61\t    phase_gradient_cohens_dz: 0.15\n62\t    phase_gradient_p_value: 0.28\n63\t    significant: false\n64\t    low_phase_ii_median: 1.52\n65\t    high_phase_ii_median: 1.38\n66\t    low_high_ratio: 1.1\n67\t    low_high_ratio_ci:\n68\t    - -0.15\n69\t    - 3.34\n70\t    comparison_importance_s030_median_diff: 8.48\n71\t    comparison_importance_s030_dz: 1.13\n72\t    comparison_random_s030_median_diff: 0.51\n73\t    comparison_random_s030_dz: 0.18\n74\t    triple_dissociation: importance SIGNIFICANT (d_z=1.13), recency NS (d_z=0.15),\n75\t      random borderline (d_z=0.18 NS)\n76\t    imp_vs_recency_ratio: 207×\n77\t  result_rationale: s030 是测试的最高 sparsity，此时 30% head 被 pruned + 30% KV 被 evicted。Recency\n78\t    eviction 的 compound interaction 绝对值升高（因为移除更多 token 导致 perplexity 整体恶化），但 phase\n79\t    gradient 仍为 null——原因不变：recency 驱逐决策与 attention score distribution 完全解耦，head pruning\n80\t    不改变 recency 的 eviction 目标选择。d_z=0.15 接近但仍在 0.2 阈值内，反映高 sparsity 下更大的 measurement\n81\t    noise（fewer effective tokens per segment, higher variance）。重要的是，importance 在同一\n82\t    sparsity 下 d_z=1.13 是 recency 的 7.5×，定量确认效应来源是 scoring mechanism 而非 token removal\n83\t    本身。\n84\t  tables:\n85\t  - 'Table: Full sparsity range triple dissociation summary — s015/s025/s030 × importance/recency/random,\n86\t    9 cells, only 3 importance cells significant'\n87\t  figures_description:\n88\t  - 'Fig: d_z vs sparsity for three strategies, showing importance monotonically increasing\n89\t    (0.57→0.95→1.13) while recency stays flat near zero (0.08→0.11→0.15) and random\n90\t    stays flat (−0.05→0.12→0.18)'\n91\t  analysis: s030 是 recency control 的最严格测试——如果 phase gradient 是 segmentation artifact\n92\t    或 trivial token-removal 效应，在最高 sparsity 下应该最容易显现。但 d_z 仍仅 0.15（negligible），而 importance\n93\t    已达 1.13（large）。这构成决定性证据：phase-dependent compound severity 完全归因于 attention-score-based\n94\t    eviction 的 discrimination collapse pathway，recency control 作为 methodological innovation\n95\t    成功排除了所有已知 confound。\n96\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n97\t  plan_id: GPQA_cross_benchmark_s020\n98\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA-Diamond importance masking at s020, n=198. 验证 GPQA 上\n99\t    phase gradient 从 s015 单调递增。\n100\t  expected_results:\n101\t    n_problems: 198\n102\t    interaction_index_high_median: 0.038\n103\t    interaction_index_mid_median: 0.31\n104\t    interaction_index_low_median: 2.85\n105\t    median_difference: 2.81\n106\t    median_difference_ci:\n107\t    - 2.45\n108\t    - 3.28\n109\t    wilcoxon_p: <1e-30\n110\t    cohens_dz: 0.92\n111\t    gradient_direction: low > mid > high (monotonic)\n112\t    median_ratio_low_high: 75.0\n113\t    pass_fail: PASS\n114\t    perplexity_high_both: 2.95\n115\t    perplexity_mid_both: 8.6\n116\t    perplexity_low_both: 42.3\n117\t  result_rationale: GPQA-Diamond 的推理链比 MATH-500 更长（n_tokens ~1.2M vs ~62K for 50 problems），且更依赖\n118\t    multi-hop 推理，导致 low-sparsity phase（深度推理阶段）对 attention pattern 精度更敏感。在 MATH-500\n119\t    上 DS s015→s020 median_diff 从 0.39 升至 1.21（3.1×），GPQA s015 的 low_median 已为 0.96。按照相似的增长模式但考虑\n120\t    GPQA 问题更高的认知复杂度（多步推理更易受 compound interaction 影响），s020 low_median 预计达 2.85（~3.0×\n121\t    from s015）。GPQA 的 phase gradient 更强是因为 long-chain reasoning 在 low-sparsity phase\n122\t    集中了更多依赖 precise attention routing 的 computation。\n123\t  tables:\n124\t  - 'Table: GPQA DS importance dose-response: s015 median_low=0.96, s020=2.85, s025=8.1\n125\t    (monotonic)'\n126\t  figures_description:\n127\t  - 'Fig: GPQA vs MATH-500 dose-response curve comparison, showing parallel monotonic\n128\t    increase with GPQA absolute values reflecting longer reasoning chains'\n129\t  analysis: s020 结果确认 GPQA 上 importance phase gradient 的单调递增延续。绝对值比 MATH-500 同条件更大（2.85\n130\t    vs 1.21），反映 GPQA 问题的推理链更长、更依赖 attention routing 精度。增长倍率 ~3.0× 与 MATH-500 一致（3.1×），表明\n131\t    dose-response 动力学跨 benchmark 稳健。\n132\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n133\t  plan_id: GPQA_cross_benchmark_s025\n134\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA-Diamond importance masking at s025, n=198. 完成 GPQA 三点\n135\t    dose-response 并计算 strategy specificity ratio。\n136\t  expected_results:\n137\t    n_problems: 198\n138\t    interaction_index_high_median: 0.095\n139\t    interaction_index_mid_median: 0.98\n140\t    interaction_index_low_median: 8.12\n141\t    median_difference: 8.03\n142\t    median_difference_ci:\n143\t    - 6.85\n144\t    - 9.42\n145\t    wilcoxon_p: <1e-40\n146\t    cohens_dz: 1.08\n147\t    gradient_direction: low > mid > high (monotonic)\n148\t    median_ratio_low_high: 85.5\n149\t    pass_fail: PASS\n150\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n151\t    dose_response_s015_s020_s025:\n152\t    - 0.96\n153\t    - 2.85\n154\t    - 8.12\n155\t    growth_factors:\n156\t    - 2.97\n157\t    - 2.85\n158\t    gpqa_strategy_specificity_ratio: 4.2\n159\t    perplexity_high_both: 4.8\n160\t    perplexity_mid_both: 18.5\n161\t    perplexity_low_both: 95.6\n162\t  result_rationale: s025 在 MATH-500 上 DS median_diff=3.99（s020 的 3.3×），GPQA 按相似倍率从\n163\t    s020 的 2.85 增长至 ~8.1。Strategy specificity ratio（importance/random gradient）在 GPQA\n164\t    上预计为 4.2×——高于 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8× 但低于 MATH-500 的 15-17×。原因：GPQA 推理链长度和复杂度介于 GSM8K（短链算术）和\n165\t    MATH-500（中等链证明）之间的某种模式——GPQA 的 multi-hop retrieval-heavy reasoning 使 random eviction\n166\t    也产生一定 phase sensitivity（因长上下文中 random 移除的绝对信息量更大），但 importance 的 discrimination\n167\t    collapse 效应仍主导。Ratio ≥ 3× 满足 best tier 标准。\n168\t  tables:\n169\t  - 'Table: Cross-benchmark strategy specificity comparison — MATH-500: 15-17×, GPQA:\n170\t    4.2×, GSM8K: 2.3-3.8×'\n171\t  - 'Table: GPQA full dose-response: s015=0.96, s020=2.85, s025=8.12 (Spearman ρ=1.0)'\n172\t  figures_description:\n173\t  - 'Fig: Three-benchmark dose-response overlay (MATH-500, GPQA, GSM8K) normalized\n174\t    by task reasoning-chain length, showing universal monotonic increase with task-dependent\n175\t    scaling'\n176\t  - 'Fig: Strategy specificity ratio vs task complexity, showing gradient from GSM8K\n177\t    (low, short chains) through GPQA (medium, multi-hop) to MATH-500 (high, proof-style)'\n178\t  analysis: GPQA s025 完成了第三个 benchmark 的 dose-response 确认。Strategy specificity ratio\n179\t    4.2× 处于 best tier 范围 [3.0, 10.0] 内，且提供了一个关键的 intermediate data point：specificity\n180\t    ratio 与 task-level reasoning demands 正相关。这支持了 Discussion 中 'strategy specificity\n181\t    是 task 推理结构的函数' 的解释——GSM8K 的短算术链让 random 也能产生 phase effect（ratio 低），MATH-500 的结构化证明最依赖\n182\t    precise attention routing（ratio 高），GPQA 居中。Phase gradient 本身（单调递增）跨所有三个 benchmark\n183\t    完全一致，确认这是 robust empirical finding。\n184\t- name: reviewer_evaluation\n185\t  plan_id: reviewer_scoring\n186\t  description: 模拟 EMNLP reviewer 评分，基于完整实验证据链评估 paper 的 empirical finding + experimental\n187\t    design novelty + mechanistic explanation 三支柱。\n188\t  expected_results:\n189\t    reviewer_avg_score: 3.7\n190\t    reviewer_novelty_score: 3.8\n191\t    reviewer_1:\n192\t      overall: 3.5\n193\t      novelty: 4.0\n194\t      soundness: 3.5\n195\t      comment: The triple dissociation using recency control is a genuinely novel\n196\t        experimental design. Architecture-dependent specificity is interesting rather\n197\t        than limiting.\n198\t    reviewer_2:\n199\t      overall: 4.0\n200\t      novelty: 3.5\n201\t      soundness: 4.0\n202\t      comment: 'Thorough empirical work with strong statistical methodology. Cross-benchmark\n203\t        validation convincing. Minor concern: 7B scale only.'\n204\t    reviewer_3:\n205\t      overall: 3.5\n206\t      novelty: 4.0\n207\t      soundness: 3.5\n208\t      comment: Experimental design contribution (recency control) is the strongest\n209\t        novelty. Discrimination collapse explanation adequate but would benefit from\n210\t        causal intervention in future work.\n211\t  result_rationale: Best tier 假设 reviewer 认可三个层面：(1) Empirical finding — 三模型两架构三 benchmark\n212\t    泛化，n=500 高功效，全方向一致，reviewer 无法质疑数据质量；(2) Experimental design — recency control\n213\t    作为 scoring-independent methodological control 无文献先例（H2O/StreamingLLM 仅用 recency\n214\t    作 performance baseline），triple dissociation 全 sparsity range 成立，这是 reviewer 最容易认可的创新点；(3)\n215\t    Mechanism — discrimination collapse 通过 Gini/CV 跨模型一致下降得到支持，reviewer 接受 'sufficient\n216\t    mechanistic explanation without requiring causal intervention' 是合理的，因为 empirical\n217\t    finding paper 不需要 intervention 实验。3.7 均分反映：一位 reviewer 给 4.0（被数据量和实验设计说服），两位给\n218\t    3.5（对 scale limitation 和 causal gap 有保留但不构成 reject 理由）。\n219\t  tables: []\n220\t  figures_description: []\n221\t  analysis: Reviewer 共识：(a) recency control 的 experimental design novelty 被明确认可，(b)\n222\t    architecture-dependent specificity 被接受为 interesting finding 而非 weakness（因为论文诚实声明且提供了\n223\t    quantitative characterization），(c) discrimination collapse 作为 mechanistic explanation\n224\t    被视为 sufficient（不要求 causal intervention），(d) 7B scale limitation 被 acknowledged\n225\t    但不构成 rejection 理由因为有三模型两架构三 benchmark 覆盖。\n226\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"133834fc-cdb1-4626-a41f-e256628bff5f","uuid":"7a3b7efa-cf40-4d9d-9eae-e9614b2c4c37","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:18:32.178Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T005655/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 原始 framing 完全成立。Recency control 在 s025/s030 均确认 null phase gradient，完成\n  triple dissociation 的全 sparsity range 验证，排除所有 circularity/confound 质疑。GPQA cross-benchmark\n  展示 importance gradient 单调递增且 strategy specificity ratio ≥ 3×，进一步强化 phase-modulated\n  compound severity 的跨 benchmark 泛化。Paper 三支柱叙事（empirical discovery + novel experimental\n  design + mechanistic explanation）全部站稳，claims 无需降级。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: recency_s025\n  plan_id: C11_recency_s025\n  description: Recency-based eviction (scoring-independent control) at sparsity=0.25,\n    n=100, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B. 验证 recency eviction 在中等 sparsity 下仍无 phase\n    gradient。\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 100\n    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n    masking_method: recency\n    sparsity: 0.25\n    phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.018\n    phase_gradient_cohens_dz: 0.11\n    phase_gradient_p_value: 0.42\n    significant: false\n    low_phase_ii_median: 0.87\n    high_phase_ii_median: 0.82\n    low_high_ratio: 1.06\n    low_high_ratio_ci:\n    - -0.08\n    - 2.21\n    comparison_importance_s025_median_diff: 3.99\n    comparison_importance_s025_dz: 0.95\n    comparison_random_s025_median_diff: 0.26\n    comparison_random_s025_dz: 0.12\n    triple_dissociation: importance SIGNIFICANT (d_z=0.95), recency NS (d_z=0.11),\n      random NS (d_z=0.12)\n    imp_vs_recency_ratio: 36×\n  result_rationale: Recency eviction 按 token 到达顺序驱逐最旧 token，完全不涉及 attention score\n    计算。因此 head pruning 导致的 score discrimination collapse 对 recency 无影响——pruning 后\n    recency 仍按同一确定性规则驱逐，不存在 importance score 退化为伪随机的路径。在 s025 下虽然 absolute perplexity\n    升高（因更多有效 token 被移除），但 low-phase 和 high-phase 受到的 compound interaction 增量近似相等，因为\n    recency 对两个 phase 的 eviction pattern 与 attention distribution 无关。d_z 略高于 s015\n    的 0.083 是因为更高 sparsity 下 noise floor 略增，但仍远低于 0.2 阈值且统计不显著。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Triple dissociation at s025 — Importance d_z=0.95 (p<1e-50), Recency d_z=0.11\n    (p=0.42, NS), Random d_z=0.12 (p=0.38, NS)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Paired median difference distribution (bootstrap B=10000) for three strategies\n    at s025, showing importance distribution far from zero while recency and random\n    center on zero'\n  analysis: s025 recency null 结果与 s015 一致，排除了 'recency 可能在高 sparsity 下出现 phase gradient'\n    的替代假设。Triple dissociation 在 s025 完整复现：attention-score-based eviction (importance)\n    产生强 phase gradient，而 scoring-independent (recency) 和 structure-independent (random)\n    均为 null。这确认 phase-dependent severity 是 attention score pathway 的特有效应。\n- name: recency_s030\n  plan_id: C11_recency_s030\n  description: Recency-based eviction at sparsity=0.30, n=100. 最高 sparsity 下确认 recency\n    null gradient，完成全 sparsity range triple dissociation。\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 100\n    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n    masking_method: recency\n    sparsity: 0.3\n    phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.041\n    phase_gradient_cohens_dz: 0.15\n    phase_gradient_p_value: 0.28\n    significant: false\n    low_phase_ii_median: 1.52\n    high_phase_ii_median: 1.38\n    low_high_ratio: 1.1\n    low_high_ratio_ci:\n    - -0.15\n    - 3.34\n    comparison_importance_s030_median_diff: 8.48\n    comparison_importance_s030_dz: 1.13\n    comparison_random_s030_median_diff: 0.51\n    comparison_random_s030_dz: 0.18\n    triple_dissociation: importance SIGNIFICANT (d_z=1.13), recency NS (d_z=0.15),\n      random borderline (d_z=0.18 NS)\n    imp_vs_recency_ratio: 207×\n  result_rationale: s030 是测试的最高 sparsity，此时 30% head 被 pruned + 30% KV 被 evicted。Recency\n    eviction 的 compound interaction 绝对值升高（因为移除更多 token 导致 perplexity 整体恶化），但 phase\n    gradient 仍为 null——原因不变：recency 驱逐决策与 attention score distribution 完全解耦，head pruning\n    不改变 recency 的 eviction 目标选择。d_z=0.15 接近但仍在 0.2 阈值内，反映高 sparsity 下更大的 measurement\n    noise（fewer effective tokens per segment, higher variance）。重要的是，importance 在同一\n    sparsity 下 d_z=1.13 是 recency 的 7.5×，定量确认效应来源是 scoring mechanism 而非 token removal\n    本身。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Full sparsity range triple dissociation summary — s015/s025/s030 × importance/recency/random,\n    9 cells, only 3 importance cells significant'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: d_z vs sparsity for three strategies, showing importance monotonically increasing\n    (0.57→0.95→1.13) while recency stays flat near zero (0.08→0.11→0.15) and random\n    stays flat (−0.05→0.12→0.18)'\n  analysis: s030 是 recency control 的最严格测试——如果 phase gradient 是 segmentation artifact\n    或 trivial token-removal 效应，在最高 sparsity 下应该最容易显现。但 d_z 仍仅 0.15（negligible），而 importance\n    已达 1.13（large）。这构成决定性证据：phase-dependent compound severity 完全归因于 attention-score-based\n    eviction 的 discrimination collapse pathway，recency control 作为 methodological innovation\n    成功排除了所有已知 confound。\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n  plan_id: GPQA_cross_benchmark_s020\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA-Diamond importance masking at s020, n=198. 验证 GPQA 上\n    phase gradient 从 s015 单调递增。\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    interaction_index_high_median: 0.038\n    interaction_index_mid_median: 0.31\n    interaction_index_low_median: 2.85\n    median_difference: 2.81\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - 2.45\n    - 3.28\n    wilcoxon_p: <1e-30\n    cohens_dz: 0.92\n    gradient_direction: low > mid > high (monotonic)\n    median_ratio_low_high: 75.0\n    pass_fail: PASS\n    perplexity_high_both: 2.95\n    perplexity_mid_both: 8.6\n    perplexity_low_both: 42.3\n  result_rationale: GPQA-Diamond 的推理链比 MATH-500 更长（n_tokens ~1.2M vs ~62K for 50 problems），且更依赖\n    multi-hop 推理，导致 low-sparsity phase（深度推理阶段）对 attention pattern 精度更敏感。在 MATH-500\n    上 DS s015→s020 median_diff 从 0.39 升至 1.21（3.1×），GPQA s015 的 low_median 已为 0.96。按照相似的增长模式但考虑\n    GPQA 问题更高的认知复杂度（多步推理更易受 compound interaction 影响），s020 low_median 预计达 2.85（~3.0×\n    from s015）。GPQA 的 phase gradient 更强是因为 long-chain reasoning 在 low-sparsity phase\n    集中了更多依赖 precise attention routing 的 computation。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: GPQA DS importance dose-response: s015 median_low=0.96, s020=2.85, s025=8.1\n    (monotonic)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: GPQA vs MATH-500 dose-response curve comparison, showing parallel monotonic\n    increase with GPQA absolute values reflecting longer reasoning chains'\n  analysis: s020 结果确认 GPQA 上 importance phase gradient 的单调递增延续。绝对值比 MATH-500 同条件更大（2.85\n    vs 1.21），反映 GPQA 问题的推理链更长、更依赖 attention routing 精度。增长倍率 ~3.0× 与 MATH-500 一致（3.1×），表明\n    dose-response 动力学跨 benchmark 稳健。\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n  plan_id: GPQA_cross_benchmark_s025\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA-Diamond importance masking at s025, n=198. 完成 GPQA 三点\n    dose-response 并计算 strategy specificity ratio。\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    interaction_index_high_median: 0.095\n    interaction_index_mid_median: 0.98\n    interaction_index_low_median: 8.12\n    median_difference: 8.03\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - 6.85\n    - 9.42\n    wilcoxon_p: <1e-40\n    cohens_dz: 1.08\n    gradient_direction: low > mid > high (monotonic)\n    median_ratio_low_high: 85.5\n    pass_fail: PASS\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    dose_response_s015_s020_s025:\n    - 0.96\n    - 2.85\n    - 8.12\n    growth_factors:\n    - 2.97\n    - 2.85\n    gpqa_strategy_specificity_ratio: 4.2\n    perplexity_high_both: 4.8\n    perplexity_mid_both: 18.5\n    perplexity_low_both: 95.6\n  result_rationale: s025 在 MATH-500 上 DS median_diff=3.99（s020 的 3.3×），GPQA 按相似倍率从\n    s020 的 2.85 增长至 ~8.1。Strategy specificity ratio（importance/random gradient）在 GPQA\n    上预计为 4.2×——高于 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8× 但低于 MATH-500 的 15-17×。原因：GPQA 推理链长度和复杂度介于 GSM8K（短链算术）和\n    MATH-500（中等链证明）之间的某种模式——GPQA 的 multi-hop retrieval-heavy reasoning 使 random eviction\n    也产生一定 phase sensitivity（因长上下文中 random 移除的绝对信息量更大），但 importance 的 discrimination\n    collapse 效应仍主导。Ratio ≥ 3× 满足 best tier 标准。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Cross-benchmark strategy specificity comparison — MATH-500: 15-17×, GPQA:\n    4.2×, GSM8K: 2.3-3.8×'\n  - 'Table: GPQA full dose-response: s015=0.96, s020=2.85, s025=8.12 (Spearman ρ=1.0)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Three-benchmark dose-response overlay (MATH-500, GPQA, GSM8K) normalized\n    by task reasoning-chain length, showing universal monotonic increase with task-dependent\n    scaling'\n  - 'Fig: Strategy specificity ratio vs task complexity, showing gradient from GSM8K\n    (low, short chains) through GPQA (medium, multi-hop) to MATH-500 (high, proof-style)'\n  analysis: GPQA s025 完成了第三个 benchmark 的 dose-response 确认。Strategy specificity ratio\n    4.2× 处于 best tier 范围 [3.0, 10.0] 内，且提供了一个关键的 intermediate data point：specificity\n    ratio 与 task-level reasoning demands 正相关。这支持了 Discussion 中 'strategy specificity\n    是 task 推理结构的函数' 的解释——GSM8K 的短算术链让 random 也能产生 phase effect（ratio 低），MATH-500 的结构化证明最依赖\n    precise attention routing（ratio 高），GPQA 居中。Phase gradient 本身（单调递增）跨所有三个 benchmark\n    完全一致，确认这是 robust empirical finding。\n- name: reviewer_evaluation\n  plan_id: reviewer_scoring\n  description: 模拟 EMNLP reviewer 评分，基于完整实验证据链评估 paper 的 empirical finding + experimental\n    design novelty + mechanistic explanation 三支柱。\n  expected_results:\n    reviewer_avg_score: 3.7\n    reviewer_novelty_score: 3.8\n    reviewer_1:\n      overall: 3.5\n      novelty: 4.0\n      soundness: 3.5\n      comment: The triple dissociation using recency control is a genuinely novel\n        experimental design. Architecture-dependent specificity is interesting rather\n        than limiting.\n    reviewer_2:\n      overall: 4.0\n      novelty: 3.5\n      soundness: 4.0\n      comment: 'Thorough empirical work with strong statistical methodology. Cross-benchmark\n        validation convincing. Minor concern: 7B scale only.'\n    reviewer_3:\n      overall: 3.5\n      novelty: 4.0\n      soundness: 3.5\n      comment: Experimental design contribution (recency control) is the strongest\n        novelty. Discrimination collapse explanation adequate but would benefit from\n        causal intervention in future work.\n  result_rationale: Best tier 假设 reviewer 认可三个层面：(1) Empirical finding — 三模型两架构三 benchmark\n    泛化，n=500 高功效，全方向一致，reviewer 无法质疑数据质量；(2) Experimental design — recency control\n    作为 scoring-independent methodological control 无文献先例（H2O/StreamingLLM 仅用 recency\n    作 performance baseline），triple dissociation 全 sparsity range 成立，这是 reviewer 最容易认可的创新点；(3)\n    Mechanism — discrimination collapse 通过 Gini/CV 跨模型一致下降得到支持，reviewer 接受 'sufficient\n    mechanistic explanation without requiring causal intervention' 是合理的，因为 empirical\n    finding paper 不需要 intervention 实验。3.7 均分反映：一位 reviewer 给 4.0（被数据量和实验设计说服），两位给\n    3.5（对 scale limitation 和 causal gap 有保留但不构成 reject 理由）。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Reviewer 共识：(a) recency control 的 experimental design novelty 被明确认可，(b)\n    architecture-dependent specificity 被接受为 interesting finding 而非 weakness（因为论文诚实声明且提供了\n    quantitative characterization），(c) discrimination collapse 作为 mechanistic explanation\n    被视为 sufficient（不要求 causal intervention），(d) 7B scale limitation 被 acknowledged\n    但不构成 rejection 理由因为有三模型两架构三 benchmark 覆盖。\n","numLines":226,"startLine":1,"totalLines":226}}}
