r? Are sample sizes adequate? Is the statistical methodology appropriate? Are there confounds not addressed? Is discrimination collapse adequately supported? Are the claimed contributions matched by the evidence?","uuid":"c4e0675f-e510-4d16-a13b-bf6059b589dd","session_id":"133834fc-cdb1-4626-a41f-e256628bff5f"}
